UP052 [*] Use `Generator` instead of `Iterator` for a context manager
 --> UP052_aliases.py:7:23
  |
6 | @_contextmanager
7 | def synchronous() -> "_Iterator[int]":
  |                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
8 |     yield 1
  |
help: Replace with `Generator`
  |
6 | @_contextmanager
  - def synchronous() -> "_Iterator[int]":
7 + def synchronous() -> "_Generator[int, None, None]":
8 |     yield 1
  |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

UP052 [*] Use `AsyncGenerator` instead of `AsyncIterator` for a context manager
